  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru-verb: {面談|めんだん}する (to have an interview/meeting)\n{面談|めんだん} emphasizes a face-to-face discussion and is commonly used in business and educational settings.\n\nTYPES:\n- {個人|こじん}{面談|めんだん} (individual meeting)\n- {保護者|ほごしゃ}{面談|めんだん} (parent-teacher conference)\n- {就職|しゅうしょく}{面談|めんだん} (job interview - though {面接|めんせつ} more common)\n- {進路|しんろ}{面談|めんだん} (career guidance meeting)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {面接|めんせつ} (job interview - more formal)\n- {会談|かいだん} (talks, conference - more official)\n- {相談|そうだん} (consultation - less formal)\n- ミーティング (meeting - loanword)",
